# 3. Backend assumption: BLUI first

Initial backend: **getnamo/BLUI-Unreal**.

BLUI provides the browser/rendering layer:

```text
CEF/Chromium runtime
HTML/CSS/JS execution
UMG widget / browser texture integration
local:// loading from project web content
ExecuteJS / browser interop primitives
```

GameWebUI should initially wrap BLUI rather than rewrite its renderer.

Long-term, the backend should remain replaceable:

```text
GameWebUI core
  -> BLUI backend
  -> UCefView backend later
  -> built-in WebBrowser backend later
```

The user-facing API should not change if the backend changes.

