# 13. Dedicated preview system

## 13.1 Core requirement

The HUD must be previewable without running Unreal.

The preview should open in a small dedicated window.

The preview must support:

```text
sliders for numbers
checkboxes for booleans
dropdowns for enums
text fields for strings
buttons for events
payload forms for events with params
live updates in real time
```

No timeline simulation is required.

## 13.2 Same CEF runtime requirement

Accurate preview must use the same CEF/Chromium binaries as the runtime backend.

Do not use Electron for accurate preview.

Do not rely only on installed Chrome.

Reason:

```text
UE runtime uses BLUI CEF.
If preview uses another Chromium build, layout/rendering bugs may be hidden.
```

So there are two preview modes:

| Mode             | Browser engine        | Purpose                       |
| ---------------- | --------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| Fast dev preview | normal browser/Vite   | fast iteration                |
| Accurate preview | same BLUI CEF runtime | authoritative rendering check |

The dedicated preview window should target accurate preview.

## 13.3 Preview host

Create a `GameWebUIPreview` executable.

Responsibilities:

```text
load same backend CEF runtime used by BLUI backend
load HUD URL or local dist/index.html
load generated schema JSON
inject GameWebUI preview transport
render HUD area
render generated controls panel
push preview state patches into HUD
trigger preview events into HUD
```

UI layout:

```text
┌───────────────────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────┐
│                                               │ State              │
│       HUD rendered in same CEF runtime        │ currentSpread [---]│
│                                               │ crosshairMode [v]  │
│                                               │ canInteract [x]    │
│                                               │ currentAmmo [ 12 ] │
│                                               │ prompt [text]      │
│                                               │                    │
│                                               │ Events             │
│                                               │ [PlayerFiredShot]  │
│                                               │ [HitConfirmed]     │
└───────────────────────────────────────────────┴────────────────────┘
```

