## 13.5 Preview transport

The HUD code must not care where values came from.

Same frontend code should work in:

```text
UE runtime
accurate CEF preview
browser dev preview
```

Runtime transport:

```text
BLUI/CEF receives UE patches/events
```

Preview transport:

```text
preview control panel calls applyPatch / emitEvent
```

The generated facade should call the same client runtime in all modes.

