# 14. Dynamic crosshair dogfood sample

## 14.1 Goal

This sample is the validation target for the whole API.

It must be built using:

```text
reflected UE state
reflected UE events
generated TS facade
generated preview controls
generic field/event methods
same runtime/preview frontend code
