# Amendments to GameWebUI Engineering Brief

## Amendment 1: No separate “fast browser preview” mode

Remove the idea of having two preview modes:

```text
Fast browser preview
Accurate CEF preview
```

The project should only offer **one official preview path**:

```text
GameWebUI Preview
→ always uses the bundled CEF/Chromium runtime from the active backend
→ never relies on the user’s installed browser
→ never relies on Electron’s Chromium
→ never uses “normal Chrome” as the authoritative preview
```

Reason:

```text
The preview should be trustworthy by default.
If runtime uses BLUI’s bundled CEF, preview must use the same bundled CEF.
A slightly slower but accurate preview is better than a fast preview that lies.
```

The preview is expected to be fast enough for practical HUD iteration.

### Replace previous preview mode table with this

```md
