GameWebUI provides a dedicated preview window that runs without launching Unreal Editor.

The preview window must use the same bundled CEF/Chromium runtime as the selected runtime backend. For the initial BLUI backend, this means the preview host must use BLUI’s bundled CEF/Chromium runtime.

There is no separate official “fast browser preview” mode. The dedicated preview is the development preview.

| Mode | Backend | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| GameWebUI Preview | Bundled backend CEF runtime | Normal HUD/UI iteration without UE running |
| In-UE runtime | Unreal + backend CEF runtime | Final in-engine validation |
