## Amendment 4: Preview uses the same transport contract as runtime

The HUD code should not know whether it is running in Unreal or in the standalone preview.

Runtime:

```text
UE bridge
→ backend CEF
→ generated JS facade
```

Preview:

```text
GameWebUI Preview controls
→ same backend CEF
→ generated JS facade
```

Frontend code remains:

```ts
